---
/** What the endpoint renders once the workshop has ended and a form still
 *  arrives (a page built before the end, or a stale tab). The page itself
 *  stays: it is the workshop's archive page for the slides and the recording.
 *  `data-form-closed` is the page script's handle: it swaps this notice in
 *  for the form. */
import { workshop } from '../data/workshop';
---

<p class="notice" data-form-closed>
  The workshop has taken place and registration is closed. Slides and the recording
  will appear on <a href={workshop.path}>the workshop page</a>.
</p>
